docs.body:
Rated line capacity, river unit: 4440 units/h
Note: this revises the Rated line capacity, river unit given in evd845 to the new value above.
Controller preset: {"mode":"derate","step":6,"until":"09:00"}

Interlock map: {"trip":["P9","V6"],"reset":"manual"}
Alarm caption: display reads "E-98 low flow" after restart
Note: this revises the current Alarm caption to the new value above.

Export folder: F:\export\quay\u07\raw.dat
Note: this revises the Export folder given in the Shift log extract, north plant to the new value above.
Alarm profile: {"level":"standby","latch":true,"ack":"QY"}

Controller preset: {"mode":"derate","step":4,"until":"08:15"}
Daily inspection quota, quay unit: 4881 samples
Instruction: state the Two-desk inspection quota, which is the Net inspection quota plus the Daily inspection quota, quay unit. Name the entries it was computed from.

Interlock map: {"trip":["P6","V3"],"reset":"manual"}
Nominal pump flow, quay unit: 6900 L/min
Note: this revises the Nominal pump flow, quay unit that read 8260 L/min to the new value above.

Nominal pump flow, south unit: 2440 L/min
Note: this revises the Nominal pump flow, south unit that read 6360 L/min to the new value above.
Alarm profile: {"level":"spare","latch":true,"ack":"VL"}

Controller preset: {"mode":"derate","step":2,"until":"05:00"}
Nominal pump flow, quay unit: 9040 L/min
Note: this revises the Nominal pump flow, quay unit given in evd750 to the new value above.

Nominal pump flow, quay unit: 3180 L/min
Note: this revises the current Nominal pump flow, quay unit to the new value above.
Interlock map: {"trip":["P2","V2"],"reset":"manual"}

Scheduler rule: {"job":"flush","every":"5h","skip":["sat","sun"]}
Withdrawal notice: WDN-1331-HH
Note: this withdraws the Controller preset given in the Utilities desk note, south plant. That item is cancelled and no longer in force.

Nominal pump flow, west unit: 2780 L/min
Instruction: state the Two-pump working flow, which is the Throttled pump flow plus the Nominal pump flow, west unit. Name the entries it was computed from.
Controller preset: {"mode":"derate","step":6,"until":"02:30"}

Reserve margin: 23 kWh
Note: this revises the Reserve margin given in the Utilities desk note, north plant to the new value above.
Interlock map: {"trip":["P4","V7"],"reset":"manual"}

Shift energy budget, quay unit: 4878 kWh
Note: this revises the Shift energy budget, quay unit given in evd174 to the new value above.
Alarm profile: {"level":"relief","latch":true,"ack":"KC"}

Safety reserve: 223 L
Instruction: state the Usable coolant stock, which is the Coolant stock, south unit minus the Safety reserve. Name the entries it was computed from.
Alarm profile: {"level":"bypass","latch":true,"ack":"GD"}

Feeder design load, river unit: 9720 kW
Note: this revises the Feeder design load, river unit that read 5100 kW to the new value above.
Controller preset: {"mode":"derate","step":1,"until":"03:00"}

Coolant stock, south unit: 1632 L
Note: this revises the Coolant stock, south unit given in evd189 to the new value above.
Interlock map: {"trip":["P3","V1"],"reset":"manual"}

Yield target: 70 percent
Instruction: state the Target batch yield, which is the Yield target applied as a percentage to the Contract batch size, north unit. Name the entries it was computed from.
Controller preset: {"mode":"derate","step":1,"until":"04:00"}

Alarm profile: {"level":"amber","latch":true,"ack":"NQ"}
Shift energy budget, north unit: 4669 kWh
Note: this revises the current Shift energy budget, north unit to the new value above.

Shift energy budget, east unit: 2125 kWh
Instruction: state the Two-shift usable energy, which is the Usable shift energy plus the Shift energy budget, east unit. Name the entries it was computed from.
Controller preset: {"mode":"derate","step":5,"until":"01:30"}

Cancellation code: CNL-9829-LL
Note: this withdraws the Provisional permit given in evd725. That item is cancelled and no longer in force.
Scheduler rule: {"job":"flush","every":"3h","skip":["sat","sun"]}

Alarm profile: {"level":"legacy","latch":true,"ack":"GW"}
Licensed storage volume, quay unit: 2300 m3
Note: this revises the Licensed storage volume, quay unit given in the Control room bulletin, quay plant to the new value above.

Maintenance holdback: 61 slots
Instruction: state the Open truck slots, which is the Truck slot allocation, north unit minus the Maintenance holdback. Name the entries it was computed from.
Controller preset: {"mode":"derate","step":3,"until":"05:00"}

Interlock map: {"trip":["P5","V7"],"reset":"manual"}
Truck slot allocation, south unit: 3111 slots
Note: this revises the Truck slot allocation, south unit that read 2027 slots to the new value above.

Scheduler rule: {"job":"flush","every":"9h","skip":["sat","sun"]}
Truck slot allocation, north unit: 3357 slots
Note: this revises the Truck slot allocation, north unit given in evd388 to the new value above.

Calibration certificate: CAL-308/M62
Note: this revises the current Calibration certificate to the new value above.
Controller preset: {"mode":"derate","step":6,"until":"08:30"}

Alarm profile: {"level":"relief","latch":true,"ack":"FV"}
Weekly overtime pool, north unit: 5817 hours
Note: this revises the Weekly overtime pool, north unit that read 4508 hours to the new value above.

Daily inspection quota, east unit: 4293 samples
Instruction: state the Two-desk inspection quota, which is the Net inspection quota plus the Daily inspection quota, east unit. Name the entries it was computed from.
Scheduler rule: {"job":"flush","every":"6h","skip":["sat","sun"]}

Contract batch size, north unit: 8200 kg
Note: this revises the current Contract batch size, north unit to the new value above.
Interlock map: {"trip":["P1","V0"],"reset":"manual"}

Alarm profile: {"level":"standby","latch":true,"ack":"MM"}
Daily inspection quota, east unit: 2256 samples
Note: this revises the current Daily inspection quota, east unit to the new value above.
